			(property "Description" "Addressable RGB LED - 1 Wire  Common names: WS2812, SK6812, Neopixel, APA-106, etc.  SMD LED with built-in controller IC.\n\n• Color: Red/Green/Blue\n\nSparkFun Products:\n\n• LED-SMD RGB (WS2812)\n• LED - RGB Addressable, PTH, 5mm Diffused (5 Pack)\n• LED - RGB Addressable, PTH, 5mm Clear (5 Pack)\n• Blynk Board - ESP8266\n\nDatasheet referenced for footprint: https://cdn.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Components/LED/COM-12877.pdf WS2812B-PTH"
